@startuml
!theme cyborg
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontColor #F3F4F6
skinparam ArrowColor #CBD5E1
skinparam shadowing false
title Protected Delivery Decision Rules
start
:Establish current link-scoped viewer context;
if (Current link / viewer policy valid?) then (yes)
 :Resolve selected publication, language and requested material;
 if (Exact selection and download / view eligibility allowed?) then (yes)
  :Resolve usable exact artifact / representation;
  if (Material available and authorized?) then (yes)
   :Deliver only permitted selected content;
  else (no)
   :Return safe unavailable / denied outcome;
  endif
 else (no)
  :Return safe denied / hidden outcome;
 endif
else (no)
 :Return safe invalid / changed-access outcome;
endif
:Never substitute unrelated language, draft or private artifact;
stop
@enduml
